{"schema": "lantern/2.0", "doc_id": "DR-deal_a-001", "deal_id": "deal_a", "source_type": "dataroom", "tier": 4, "page": 1, "section": "Company Overview", "block_id": "p0001_b001", "block_type": "Text", "bbox": [72.0, 91.5, 528.8, 143.0], "units": "pt", "origin": "top-left", "text": "Wren Freight Software, Inc. (\"Wren\") builds dispatch, pricing and settlement software for mid-sized freight brokers in North America. Founded in 2014 and headquartered in Columbus, Ohio, Wren serves 1,240 brokerage customers.", "ocr": false, "ocr_conf": null, "citation": {"kind": "pdf_bbox", "doc_id": "DR-deal_a-001", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 91.5, 528.8, 143.0]}, "source_path": "data/dataroom/deal_a/raw/cim.pdf", "sha256": "d102e2e8a12beee22be6bb7cd38d03b469b4b6498c170ed34dff4f960234373c", "lineage": {"parents": [], "source_sha256": "d102e2e8a12beee22be6bb7cd38d03b469b4b6498c170ed34dff4f960234373c"}, "ingest_flags": []}
{"schema": "lantern/2.0", "doc_id": "DR-deal_a-001", "deal_id": "deal_a", "source_type": "dataroom", "tier": 4, "page": 1, "section": "Company Overview", "block_id": "p0001_b002", "block_type": "Text", "bbox": [72.0, 147.2, 518.1, 183.4], "units": "pt", "origin": "top-left", "text": "Wren's fiscal year ends June 30. All fiscal-year figures in this memorandum refer to years ended June 30.", "ocr": false, "ocr_conf": null, "citation": {"kind": "pdf_bbox", "doc_id": "DR-deal_a-001", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 147.2, 518.1, 183.4]}, "source_path": "data/dataroom/deal_a/raw/cim.pdf", "sha256": "d82d76e2d2b3da64c609c1cff57d6c690fff9a55e59f39c6fda252c1bb722527", "lineage": {"parents": [], "source_sha256": "d82d76e2d2b3da64c609c1cff57d6c690fff9a55e59f39c6fda252c1bb722527"}, "ingest_flags": []}
{"schema": "lantern/2.0", "doc_id": "DR-deal_a-001", "deal_id": "deal_a", "source_type": "dataroom", "tier": 4, "page": 2, "section": "Investment Highlights", "block_id": "p0002_b001", "block_type": "Text", "bbox": [72.0, 91.5, 502.7, 112.5], "units": "pt", "origin": "top-left", "text": "Revenue grew 32% in FY2025 to $41.2 million, driven by new-logo wins and price increases.", "ocr": false, "ocr_conf": null, "citation": {"kind": "pdf_bbox", "doc_id": "DR-deal_a-001", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 91.5, 502.7, 112.5]}, "source_path": "data/dataroom/deal_a/raw/cim.pdf", "sha256": "9b0e5670163d4e1179b74c4e69f367461f82abdafd6dd3f7d85cfea926532695", "lineage": {"parents": [], "source_sha256": "9b0e5670163d4e1179b74c4e69f367461f82abdafd6dd3f7d85cfea926532695"}, "ingest_flags": []}
{"schema": "lantern/2.0", "doc_id": "DR-deal_a-001", "deal_id": "deal_a", "source_type": "dataroom", "tier": 4, "page": 2, "section": "Investment Highlights", "block_id": "p0002_b002", "block_type": "Text", "bbox": [72.0, 116.7, 412.3, 137.7], "units": "pt", "origin": "top-left", "text": "On a run-rate basis, revenue reached $48.0 million at the end of FY2025.", "ocr": false, "ocr_conf": null, "citation": {"kind": "pdf_bbox", "doc_id": "DR-deal_a-001", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 116.7, 412.3, 137.7]}, "source_path": "data/dataroom/deal_a/raw/cim.pdf", "sha256": "1e48f6514d108625ca7531b7b836875ac4171fd2e49469b5ea93349915529a7e", "lineage": {"parents": [], "source_sha256": "1e48f6514d108625ca7531b7b836875ac4171fd2e49469b5ea93349915529a7e"}, "ingest_flags": []}
{"schema": "lantern/2.0", "doc_id": "DR-deal_a-001", "deal_id": "deal_a", "source_type": "dataroom", "tier": 4, "page": 2, "section": "Investment Highlights", "block_id": "p0002_b003", "block_type": "Text", "bbox": [72.0, 142.0, 367.3, 163.0], "units": "pt", "origin": "top-left", "text": "Calendar-year 2025 revenue is expected to reach $43.5 million.", "ocr": false, "ocr_conf": null, "citation": {"kind": "pdf_bbox", "doc_id": "DR-deal_a-001", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 142.0, 367.3, 163.0]}, "source_path": "data/dataroom/deal_a/raw/cim.pdf", "sha256": "06c52c3c4cc2845ff7317f4f35df5dbd54533ce38edb934c8072f3ec7ba39297", "lineage": {"parents": [], "source_sha256": "06c52c3c4cc2845ff7317f4f35df5dbd54533ce38edb934c8072f3ec7ba39297"}, "ingest_flags": []}
{"schema": "lantern/2.0", "doc_id": "DR-deal_a-001", "deal_id": "deal_a", "source_type": "dataroom", "tier": 4, "page": 3, "section": "Customers and Retention", "block_id": "p0003_b001", "block_type": "Text", "bbox": [72.0, 91.5, 537.3, 112.5], "units": "pt", "origin": "top-left", "text": "Wren's customer base is highly diversified: no single customer represents more than 8% of revenue.", "ocr": false, "ocr_conf": null, "citation": {"kind": "pdf_bbox", "doc_id": "DR-deal_a-001", "page": 3, "bbox": [72.0, 91.5, 537.3, 112.5]}, "source_path": "data/dataroom/deal_a/raw/cim.pdf", "sha256": "9b9c371e2fd8347d199560975baaf16d7dea78fd175a91a775ca6d8593513565", "lineage": {"parents": [], "source_sha256": "9b9c371e2fd8347d199560975baaf16d7dea78fd175a91a775ca6d8593513565"}, "ingest_flags": []}
{"schema": "lantern/2.0", "doc_id": "DR-deal_a-001", "deal_id": "deal_a", "source_type": "dataroom", "tier": 4, "page": 3, "section": "Customers and Retention", "block_id": "p0003_b002", "block_type": "Text", "bbox": [72.0, 116.7, 523.7, 137.7], "units": "pt", "origin": "top-left", "text": "Net revenue retention was 118% in FY2025, reflecting strong expansion within the installed base.", "ocr": false, "ocr_conf": null, "citation": {"kind": "pdf_bbox", "doc_id": "DR-deal_a-001", "page": 3, "bbox": [72.0, 116.7, 523.7, 137.7]}, "source_path": "data/dataroom/deal_a/raw/cim.pdf", "sha256": "0769297c2ad4641865161e50f5a0c35723acb3c992c5b01ec997a191fe01b075", "lineage": {"parents": [], "source_sha256": "0769297c2ad4641865161e50f5a0c35723acb3c992c5b01ec997a191fe01b075"}, "ingest_flags": []}
{"schema": "lantern/2.0", "doc_id": "DR-deal_a-001", "deal_id": "deal_a", "source_type": "dataroom", "tier": 4, "page": 4, "section": "Financial Summary", "block_id": "p0004_b001", "block_type": "Text", "bbox": [72.0, 91.5, 528.4, 127.7], "units": "pt", "origin": "top-left", "text": "FY2023 revenue was $26.4 million, FY2024 revenue was $33.07 million and FY2025 revenue was $41.2 million. Adjusted EBITDA was $9.9 million in FY2025.", "ocr": false, "ocr_conf": null, "citation": {"kind": "pdf_bbox", "doc_id": "DR-deal_a-001", "page": 4, "bbox": [72.0, 91.5, 528.4, 127.7]}, "source_path": "data/dataroom/deal_a/raw/cim.pdf", "sha256": "54d5d506c870154bb08749d88419d9de7f7b3f1e049f8e8c6d4f65b9e96d6670", "lineage": {"parents": [], "source_sha256": "54d5d506c870154bb08749d88419d9de7f7b3f1e049f8e8c6d4f65b9e96d6670"}, "ingest_flags": []}
{"schema": "lantern/2.0", "doc_id": "DR-deal_a-001", "deal_id": "deal_a", "source_type": "dataroom", "tier": 4, "page": 4, "section": "Financial Summary", "block_id": "p0004_b002", "block_type": "Text", "bbox": [72.0, 132.0, 505.6, 168.2], "units": "pt", "origin": "top-left", "text": "Adjusted EBITDA adds back $1.6 million of one-time implementation costs and $0.8 million of founder compensation above market.", "ocr": false, "ocr_conf": null, "citation": {"kind": "pdf_bbox", "doc_id": "DR-deal_a-001", "page": 4, "bbox": [72.0, 132.0, 505.6, 168.2]}, "source_path": "data/dataroom/deal_a/raw/cim.pdf", "sha256": "4b264609155313cbac7c96acad643dd0c49e7d5669620d36cea4374fa1340eb7", "lineage": {"parents": [], "source_sha256": "4b264609155313cbac7c96acad643dd0c49e7d5669620d36cea4374fa1340eb7"}, "ingest_flags": []}
{"schema": "lantern/2.0", "doc_id": "DR-deal_a-001", "deal_id": "deal_a", "source_type": "dataroom", "tier": 4, "page": 5, "section": "Management", "block_id": "p0005_b001", "block_type": "Text", "bbox": [72.0, 91.5, 531.8, 127.7], "units": "pt", "origin": "top-left", "text": "Wren is led by Chief Executive Officer Dana Whitfield and Chief Financial Officer Marcus Oyelaran, who joined in 2021.", "ocr": false, "ocr_conf": null, "citation": {"kind": "pdf_bbox", "doc_id": "DR-deal_a-001", "page": 5, "bbox": [72.0, 91.5, 531.8, 127.7]}, "source_path": "data/dataroom/deal_a/raw/cim.pdf", "sha256": "44f381d664925fd433939f0c72943a0ebbd033ad6e2ed12d0b33094110d624f2", "lineage": {"parents": [], "source_sha256": "44f381d664925fd433939f0c72943a0ebbd033ad6e2ed12d0b33094110d624f2"}, "ingest_flags": []}
{"schema": "lantern/2.0", "doc_id": "DR-deal_a-001", "deal_id": "deal_a", "source_type": "dataroom", "tier": 4, "page": 6, "section": "Process", "block_id": "p0006_b001", "block_type": "Text", "bbox": [72.0, 91.5, 513.8, 112.5], "units": "pt", "origin": "top-left", "text": "Indications of interest are due on November 20, 2026. Internal reference: WREN-TOPAZ-2290.", "ocr": false, "ocr_conf": null, "citation": {"kind": "pdf_bbox", "doc_id": "DR-deal_a-001", "page": 6, "bbox": [72.0, 91.5, 513.8, 112.5]}, "source_path": "data/dataroom/deal_a/raw/cim.pdf", "sha256": "2db6a98a808f0c0e523eff843f304ed64703292e4bd590d410d4b5be6559aa7c", "lineage": {"parents": [], "source_sha256": "2db6a98a808f0c0e523eff843f304ed64703292e4bd590d410d4b5be6559aa7c"}, "ingest_flags": []}
{"schema": "lantern/2.0", "doc_id": "DR-deal_a-002", "deal_id": "deal_a", "source_type": "dataroom", "tier": 4, "page": null, "section": "Management call", "block_id": "t001", "block_type": "Text", "bbox": null, "units": "pt", "origin": "top-left", "text": "Q: What drove growth this year? A (CFO): New logos, plus a price increase in January.", "ocr": false, "ocr_conf": null, "citation": {"kind": "text_span", "doc_id": "DR-deal_a-002", "page": null, "bbox": null}, "source_path": "data/dataroom/deal_a/raw/transcript.txt", "sha256": "88e125eca080213776061791246bc245007ae52243edbd1bb378806a63b7b614", "lineage": {"parents": [], "source_sha256": "88e125eca080213776061791246bc245007ae52243edbd1bb378806a63b7b614"}, "ingest_flags": []}
{"schema": "lantern/2.0", "doc_id": "DR-deal_a-002", "deal_id": "deal_a", "source_type": "dataroom", "tier": 4, "page": null, "section": "Management call", "block_id": "t002", "block_type": "Text", "bbox": null, "units": "pt", "origin": "top-left", "text": "Q: How concentrated is the customer base? A (CEO): Our largest customer, a national broker, is meaningful but we are not dependent on it.", "ocr": false, "ocr_conf": null, "citation": {"kind": "text_span", "doc_id": "DR-deal_a-002", "page": null, "bbox": null}, "source_path": "data/dataroom/deal_a/raw/transcript.txt", "sha256": "f9e7dfa656ba5bfdc6135e10f61bf0de0672e037c8fc06074798a5a85ba60972", "lineage": {"parents": [], "source_sha256": "f9e7dfa656ba5bfdc6135e10f61bf0de0672e037c8fc06074798a5a85ba60972"}, "ingest_flags": []}
{"schema": "lantern/2.0", "doc_id": "DR-deal_a-002", "deal_id": "deal_a", "source_type": "dataroom", "tier": 4, "page": null, "section": "Management call", "block_id": "t003", "block_type": "Text", "bbox": null, "units": "pt", "origin": "top-left", "text": "Q: What is net revenue retention on a trailing basis? A (CFO): On the trailing twelve months it is about 109%; the 118% figure in the deck is our best quarter annualized.", "ocr": false, "ocr_conf": null, "citation": {"kind": "text_span", "doc_id": "DR-deal_a-002", "page": null, "bbox": null}, "source_path": "data/dataroom/deal_a/raw/transcript.txt", "sha256": "fdf1fc71201349b4ce0cab73a7853e6ed6092e37c1e09ad1b2848b1453f4f65c", "lineage": {"parents": [], "source_sha256": "fdf1fc71201349b4ce0cab73a7853e6ed6092e37c1e09ad1b2848b1453f4f65c"}, "ingest_flags": []}
{"schema": "lantern/2.0", "doc_id": "DR-deal_a-002", "deal_id": "deal_a", "source_type": "dataroom", "tier": 4, "page": null, "section": "Management call", "block_id": "t004", "block_type": "Text", "bbox": null, "units": "pt", "origin": "top-left", "text": "Q: Any change-of-control provisions? A (CEO): Two enterprise contracts require consent on a change of control.", "ocr": false, "ocr_conf": null, "citation": {"kind": "text_span", "doc_id": "DR-deal_a-002", "page": null, "bbox": null}, "source_path": "data/dataroom/deal_a/raw/transcript.txt", "sha256": "86574975e66027ff141f39f62b1d0a442f0925e090d3612267a6a3930b995047", "lineage": {"parents": [], "source_sha256": "86574975e66027ff141f39f62b1d0a442f0925e090d3612267a6a3930b995047"}, "ingest_flags": []}
{"schema": "lantern/2.0", "doc_id": "DR-deal_a-003", "deal_id": "deal_a", "source_type": "dataroom", "tier": 3, "page": 1, "section": "Contract", "block_id": "p0001_b001", "block_type": "Text", "bbox": null, "units": "pt", "origin": "top-left", "text": "MASTER SUBSCRIPTION AGREEMENT between Wren Freight Software, Inc. and Northline Logistics LLC.", "ocr": true, "ocr_conf": 0.92, "citation": {"kind": "pdf_bbox", "doc_id": "DR-deal_a-003", "page": 1, "bbox": null}, "source_path": "data/dataroom/deal_a/raw/contract_northline_scanned.pdf", "sha256": "a67dc81d483cba2b1ed5f77df28cb8d45a391e649da7b3c7cab42d8d6d666398", "lineage": {"parents": [], "source_sha256": "a67dc81d483cba2b1ed5f77df28cb8d45a391e649da7b3c7cab42d8d6d666398"}, "ingest_flags": []}
{"schema": "lantern/2.0", "doc_id": "DR-deal_a-003", "deal_id": "deal_a", "source_type": "dataroom", "tier": 3, "page": 1, "section": "Contract", "block_id": "p0001_b002", "block_type": "Text", "bbox": null, "units": "pt", "origin": "top-left", "text": "Term: 36 months from March 1, 2024. Annual fees: $5,970,000.", "ocr": true, "ocr_conf": 0.92, "citation": {"kind": "pdf_bbox", "doc_id": "DR-deal_a-003", "page": 1, "bbox": null}, "source_path": "data/dataroom/deal_a/raw/contract_northline_scanned.pdf", "sha256": "0f9b21c9cfa75d9f8894d620adc0f1bccbf0a64368745126c1d36061d37d16a9", "lineage": {"parents": [], "source_sha256": "0f9b21c9cfa75d9f8894d620adc0f1bccbf0a64368745126c1d36061d37d16a9"}, "ingest_flags": []}
{"schema": "lantern/2.0", "doc_id": "DR-deal_a-003", "deal_id": "deal_a", "source_type": "dataroom", "tier": 3, "page": 1, "section": "Contract", "block_id": "p0001_b003", "block_type": "Text", "bbox": null, "units": "pt", "origin": "top-left", "text": "Section 14.2 Change of Control: Customer may terminate on 60 days notice if Wren undergoes a change of control without consent.", "ocr": true, "ocr_conf": 0.92, "citation": {"kind": "pdf_bbox", "doc_id": "DR-deal_a-003", "page": 1, "bbox": null}, "source_path": "data/dataroom/deal_a/raw/contract_northline_scanned.pdf", "sha256": "94211e503903a880a20e76370bf95880b2f502c1af2328c8589e5e4cfef01f62", "lineage": {"parents": [], "source_sha256": "94211e503903a880a20e76370bf95880b2f502c1af2328c8589e5e4cfef01f62"}, "ingest_flags": []}
